Dependency notices are shipped separately in THIRD_PARTY_DEPENDENCIES.html,
generated from Cargo.lock using scripts/notices.mjs before packaging. Frontend
dependency licenses are included in THIRD_PARTY_FRONTEND_NOTICES.txt.

Visual Pianos protocol adaptation: qwerty.rs and the visual-pianos-qwerty.json
preset use MIT pv.rs mappings at 73e4d6b. Raw shared modifier state, debug
logging, unbounded indexing, and panic paths are replaced by validation,
worker-owned ordered pulses, generations and delivered-state cleanup.

Unmodified selectors 0.38.0 and other MPL-covered dependencies: full covered
source is available through the exact crate version links in the dependency
notices. Their license is independent from lazymidi original MIT files.

